# Portrait phone (DPR 3): the 60-move Challenge started by touch and played to Out of moves by swipes on the board (left, down, right, up), then Retry and Leave.
# viewport 390x844@3
until 300 =Play
frames 150
save phone-title
touch =Play
until 60 Choose a mode
frames 10
touch Challenge
until 60 Setup
frames 10
save phone-modes
touch =Start
until 120 Objective
frames 60
repeat 6000 until Out of moves
  swipe 75% 45% 25% 45% 6
  frames 3
  swipe 50% 35% 50% 55% 6
  frames 3
  swipe 25% 45% 75% 45% 6
  frames 3
  swipe 50% 55% 50% 35% 6
  frames 3
end
frames 30
save phone-results
touch =Retry
until 120 Objective
frames 30
swipe 75% 45% 25% 45% 6
frames 20
save phone-play
expect Moves left: 59.
touch =Leave
until 60 Resume run
frames 10
